    "headline": "Tractor Supply Kicks off Spooky Season With a Distinctive, Farm-Inspired Flair",
    "summary": "BRENTWOOD, Tenn., August 06, 2026--Tractor Supply Company (NASDAQ: TSCO), the largest rural lifestyle retailer in the United States, is getting in the Halloween spirit with its 2026 lineup of one-of-a-kind Halloween items for those who love Life Out Here. From skeleton roosters and ghost cows to mummy chicks and \"deviled\" eggs, Tractor Supply stores and TractorSupply.com have new and exclusive farm-inspired Halloween décor customers won’t find anywhere else.",
